    "media:imagetext": "The Quick Way\nTo and From\nKennedy• LaGuardia\nNewark• Manhattan\nNEW YORK\nHELICOPTER\nSchedule \u0026 Fares\nNew York Helicopter\nReservations and Information\nCALL TOLL FREE\n1-800-645-3494\nBaggage Allowance\n(Length + width + height)\nOne piece not to exceed 62 inches plus,\nOne piece not to exceed 55 inches and\nOne small carry on (i.e. briefcase, cosmetic case, etc.)\nNOTE: No large trunks or cartons accepted\nBaggage Liability: $500.00 per passenger.\nExcess Baggage Charges\nIn excess of baggage allowance or oversized\nbaggage—$10.00 per piece.\nTicketing\nTickets may be purchased from any scheduled\nairline, your travel agent, corporate travel depart-\nment, TICKETRON or any NEW YORK HELICOPTER\nticket counter.\nCredit Cards Accepted\nAmerican Express, Diners, MasterCard, Visa and UATP\nCheck-In Time\nAt ticket counter 10 minutes prior to departure time.\nExcept World Trade Center 15 minutes.\nNew York\nHelicopter\nAIRLINE CODE: HD\nSPRING, 1984",
